{"id": null, "n": "b016001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_b016001", "type": "orig", "text": "佛塔亭、天下名山、鳳山、奉化縣、惠政橋。"}
{"id": null, "n": "b017001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_b017001", "type": "orig", "text": "塔院、普同塔、耀碑潭。"}
{"id": null, "n": "b018001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_b018001", "type": "orig", "text": "三山、大雄寶殿、天王殿、彌勒道場、鍾樓、東方丈、西方丈、娑羅樹、淨土池、藏閣、龍溪、兠率宮。"}
{"id": null, "n": "b019001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_b019001", "type": "orig", "text": "金鐘塾、鎮伏塔。"}
{"id": null, "n": "b022001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_b022001", "type": "orig", "text": "重建。"}
{"id": null, "n": "b022002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_b022002", "type": "orig", "text": "本志五處「圯」字，皆宜作「圮」。今改之，後不一一標示。"}
{"id": null, "n": "b038001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_b038001", "type": "orig", "text": "宋璟，字廣平。"}
{"id": null, "n": "b065001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_b065001", "type": "orig", "text": "栯堂益曾住持彰聖寺。"}
{"id": null, "n": "b092001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_b092001", "type": "orig", "text": "天皇寺。"}
{"id": null, "n": "b094001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_b094001", "type": "orig", "text": "底本缺文，此依上下文法、文義補。"}
